scripts/patch-whisper-gpu.py; upstream code retains its MIT license.

The supported separately imported stock multilingual Whisper Base and Small weights are
derived from OpenAI Whisper under the MIT License.
Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI.
The weights license is retained in inference-whisper/src/main/assets/licenses/Whisper-model-MIT.txt.
