Experimental Chilean Small ES-CL-2 weights are based on OpenAI Whisper and the
fine-tune by Roberto Castro-Vexler at revision
57e689bd5edc1ae84e7c8683235178a3c4505cea. The model author declares Apache-2.0.
That license is retained in assets/licenses/Chilean-model-Apache-2.0.txt alongside
